1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:03,315
(Penny:)- How do I get the sword?
- Have you been to the Temple of Mitra?

2
00:00:03,481 --> 00:00:06,191
- Is that the place on the hill with the priest?
- No, it's...

3
00:00:06,359 --> 00:00:07,989
Oh, for God's sakes, give me.

4
00:00:08,153 --> 00:00:09,823
(Penny:)Thank you. I really appreciate this.

5
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:11,908
You have to learn to do these things.

6
00:00:12,073 --> 00:00:14,363
Don't patronize me. Just get the sword.

7
00:00:16,369 --> 00:00:18,539
(Howard:)What the frak?

8
00:00:19,497 --> 00:00:22,537
(Leonard:)Beats me.
They were playing all last night too.

9
00:00:22,709 --> 00:00:26,049
(Raj:)It's like some kind
of weird comic-book crossover.

10
00:00:26,212 --> 00:00:29,882
(Howard:)Like if Hulk
were dating Peppermint Patty.

11
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:32,219
(Raj:)I always thought Peppermint Patty
was a lesbian.

12
00:00:32,385 --> 00:00:33,555
(Leonard:)No, that's Marcie.

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,180
(Leonard:)Peppermint Patty's just athletic.

14
00:00:37,098 --> 00:00:39,018
(Sheldon:)There you go, one enchanted sword.

15
00:00:39,184 --> 00:00:42,314
All right, give me, give me.
I wanna kill the guard captain.

16
00:00:46,774 --> 00:00:48,904
(Sheldon:)That girl needs to get a life.

17
00:00:58,077 --> 00:01:01,027
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

